{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots - Light on the Sea is a narrative story driven game where you live and work on a small island with a lighthouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Take care of the facility, check the weather, scout ships, file reports, order needed goods or unravel the story behind the lighthouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience changes from day to night and a random weather system with storms, rain or fog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106450/extras/a7924fd3747a6fde081c0728f9450dec.poster.avif?t=1773836820\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106450/extras/a7924fd3747a6fde081c0728f9450dec.webm?t=1773836820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106450/extras/a7924fd3747a6fde081c0728f9450dec.mp4?t=1773836820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout ships and file reports about the type and the speed in knots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106450/extras/42fc395481c67d985f191fb44669826a.poster.avif?t=1773836820\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106450/extras/42fc395481c67d985f191fb44669826a.webm?t=1773836820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106450/extras/42fc395481c67d985f191fb44669826a.mp4?t=1773836820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive on the island: Prepare food, report daily weather and earn money through reports to buy needed goods on the pc via the internet online store. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy resources for the lighthouse, ingredients for cooking, seeds for the garden etc. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to radio or just relax in the garden looking at the sunset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106450/extras/059cc938da1165c070cc1fa4774c8d52.poster.avif?t=1773836820\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106450/extras/059cc938da1165c070cc1fa4774c8d52.webm?t=1773836820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106450/extras/059cc938da1165c070cc1fa4774c8d52.mp4?t=1773836820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric story driven adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day to night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomised weather system (each playthrough will be a little bit different)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the tasks of a lighthouse keeper (take care of the light and the fog horn, scout ships, file daily weather reports, cook food, order items, plant and collect your own vegetables)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the in-game radio music (Ambient, Classic and Guitar Soundtrack available)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Professional voice acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the story behind the lighthouse</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s